                                                "sense_id": "177ab2ba-010e-3ff5-ae76-61a567ff76a6",
                                                "text": "For the first 60 miles from Padang Besar, the railway passes through a succession of rice fields, with villages at regular intervals, but then crosses a jungle-clad mountain range to reach the west coast."
